0..75 Comment "//! `in-flight` models an abandoned continuation with a pending completion."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..136 Comment "//! An abandoned continuation ends its stack\'s protocol."
137..193 Comment "//! The kernel observes cancellation in its next action."
194..197 Comment "//!"
198..229 Comment "//! The program submits a read."
230..306 Comment "//! Its handler abandons the continuation that would receive the completion."
307..310 Comment "//!"
